@@ -52,3 +52,15 @@ As mentioned previously, selecting the structured generation backend is only app
 | JSON Schema | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
 | Regex | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
 | Grammar | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
+
+### Caching XGrammar compilations
+
+`XGrammarBackend` recompiles each request by default. Set
+`cache_compiled_grammars=True` to reuse successful compilations for identical
+grammar kinds and source strings on one backend instance. Processors remain
+independent even when they share a compiled grammar.
+
+`max_cached_grammars` optionally sets a positive LRU capacity; `None` leaves
+the number of completed entries unbounded. Concurrent requests for the same
+uncached key share one compilation. A failed compilation is not retained, so a
+later request can retry.
